":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2017-02-23T15:04:18Z","updated_at":"2017-02-23T15:04:18Z","body":"1) Get the bazel installer for 0.4.4 (download here: https://github.com/bazelbuild/bazel/releases/tag/0.4.4). Don't use JDK 7.\r\n2) If \"bazel\" is the only thing in ~/.cache, run `sudo rm -rf ~/.cache/bazel` (you probably need to run this as sudo because I'm guessing ~/.cache and/or ~/.cache/bazel are owned by root).  Double check this command before running, since it's sudo rm!  (If bazel isn't the only subdirectory, just remove the bazel subdirectory and chown ~/.cache to your user/group.)\r\n3) Run `chmod +x <name of the installer you downloaded>.sh`\r\n4) Run `./<name of the installer you downloaded>.sh --user`","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/282016330/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"kchodorow","id":17042,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3MDQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17042?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow","html_url":"https://github.com/kchodorow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kchodorow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/re